o iniziò al cimitero il primo scontro fra Batman e Dracula. L'uomo pipistrello torna a casa malridotto e capisce subito che Dracula ha una forza superiore alla sua, e niente può sconfiggerlo. Nel successivo vespro, al cimitero, Joker si incontra con Pinguino, e sbadatamente, anche lui apre la bara di Dracula, così viene morso e diviene anche lui un vampiro.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"There's another bat in Gotham...","language":"en-US"},"releaseDate":"2005-10-18","status":"Released","rating":7,"ratingCount":434,"genres":["Animazione","Azione","Fantasy","Mistero"],"countries":["United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"84m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":110799,"name":"Rino Romano","role":"Bruce Wayne / Batman (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rpyq7xdQ5zSCHYiwnlPvkx7gLrl.jpg"},{"id":53,"name":"Peter Stormare","role":"Dracula (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1rtpuUqBV29jDc1huUhtjGDbEwn.jpg"},{"id":15762,"name":"Tara Strong","role":"Vicky Vale (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Cm3X7CCSuYbjW1ZKJ8vxCj4SI7.jpg"},{"id":110800,"name":"Alastair Duncan","role":"Alfred Pennyworth (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2rkDiz41uLiEYIo92DLuVOHagRS.jpg"},{"id":78798,"name":"Tom Kenny","role":"Oswald Cobblepot / The Penguin (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kftXtExrcoTTjyeYmSXJ0Ogr3R7.jpg"},{"id":24362,"name":"Kevin Michael Richardson","role":"The Joker (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xXt9Nh7RAT5bOen66TaXreNYmCl.jpg"},{"id":34982,"name":"Jeff Bennett","role":"Arkham Asylum Inmate / Additional Voices (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6Fq3Q1e0Oz0j2J2fnFSl7fKCHd9.jpg"},{"id":1172399,"name":"Richard Green","role":"Additional Voices (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ecEKuhsWNPJ57Yx2jJSatPOjLQQ.jpg"},{"id":64951,"name":"Neil Ross","role":"Additional Voices (voice)","pr